# Argus, Dark Angel

> Argus is an EXP lane fighter who wins by turning one committed target into health, tempo, and turret pressure. He is pickable when the enemy must fight him in melee range. He becomes a liability when the draft can kite, suppress, or waste his transformation without giving him something meaningful to hit.

