## Curated builds

Reviewed against patch 2.1.95 on 2026-08-18. The live patch is 2.2.16a, so these have not been re-read against it yet.

### EXP Attack-Effect Default (EXP)

- Items: Swift Boots, Corrosion Scythe, Demon Hunter Sword, Golden Staff, Haas's Claws, Malefic Roar
- Core: Corrosion Scythe, Demon Hunter Sword, Golden Staff
- Emblem: Marksman Emblem with Swift, Weapon Master, War Cry
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Flex: Sea Halberd over Haas's Claws when Use when sustain, shields, or high-extra-HP frontliners are keeping the first target alive.; Rose Gold Meteor over Malefic Roar when Use against magic burst that can force Eternal Evil before Argus reaches basic-attack range.; Wind of Nature over Haas's Claws when Use against physical basic-attack burst when one immunity window decides the Lord fight.
- Total cost: 11020 gold

Default ranked setup built around Corrosion slow, Demon Hunter Sword HP pressure, and Golden Staff attack-effect repeats.

### Split-Push Crit Pressure (EXP)

- Items: Swift Boots, Corrosion Scythe, Haas's Claws, Berserker's Fury, Golden Staff, Malefic Roar
- Core: Corrosion Scythe, Haas's Claws, Berserker's Fury
- Emblem: Marksman Emblem with Fatal, Weapon Master, War Cry
- Battle spell: Inspire
- Flex: Demon Hunter Sword over Malefic Roar when Use when the enemy front line answers you with stacked HP instead of armor, so the percent-current-HP hit beats flat penetration.; Sea Halberd over Malefic Roar when Use against Estes, Floryn, Yu Zhong, or any shield-heavy front-to-back comp that outlasts a side-lane siege.; Rose Gold Meteor over Golden Staff when Use when a magic jungler or burst mage can delete Argus on the rotation to your lane.; Immortality over Malefic Roar when Use once a single death hands over Lord or the base, and the split needs to survive the collapse rather than out-damage it.
- Total cost: 11230 gold

Side-lane pressure build. Patch 2.1.90 rebalanced Demonic Slash from 80 (+50% Total Physical Attack) to 120 (+25%) and made its regen a flat 140, which halves what raw attack items return to the passive, so this stays on the crit and attack-effect engine instead of stacking Physical Attack. Berserker's Fury carries it after the 2.1.88 rework: crits now add True Damage, which is what gets through the defender who walks into the side lane to stop the push.

### CC and Burst Safe (EXP)

- Items: Tough Boots, Corrosion Scythe, Demon Hunter Sword, Golden Staff, Rose Gold Meteor, Immortality
- Core: Corrosion Scythe, Demon Hunter Sword, Golden Staff
- Emblem: Fighter Emblem with Firmness, Weapon Master, War Cry
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Flex: Sea Halberd over Rose Gold Meteor when Use when healing or shields are the reason enemies survive Argus' first locked target.; Malefic Roar over Immortality when Use when the enemy front line is armor-heavy and Argus is not dying first.; Wind of Nature over Rose Gold Meteor when Use against physical burst or marksman focus when magic burst is not the threat.
- Total cost: 10870 gold

Safer teamfight setup for control-heavy or magic-burst games where Argus needs to survive the first lockout before attacking.

